  "description": "Since the release of Sergio Layos’ signature Sierra frame, we have always wanted to do a more trails\nspecific frame. The new Motosierra frame is a Sierra Frame version for the die hard trails riders with\na trails specific geometry.\nIt features welded chainstay brake mounts and our new 5mm invest casting dropouts for 10mm axle\ncassette, that all these pegless riders will love. Something important about this frame is that we\nare teaming up with Sergio to donate a % of the sales to a set of trails (To Be Announced) to support\nthe hard work and fun being had in these woods! Available in Gloss Dark Red and Gloss Black colors.\nOther important features are the welded chainstay brake mounts with the cable through the seat\ntube system.\n\nNote: The chain tensioner is compatible with all hubs with less than 24mm cone diameter, like Magneto Hubs, Profile,...\nThe frame come with ONE chain tensioner.",
